<!-- CANON_MATERIALS_BUILD_1 — RSW_Durasteel, the one durasteel (design/RimMandrake/canon_materials_design_2026-10-09.md
     §3.2). Canon Star Wars, so RSW tier (mandrake.rsw.armoury). Stats are KOTOR_AlloyDurasteel's (Metals2.xml), with
     StuffPower_Armor_Sharp raised 0.8 -> 0.9 (steel's) per §3.2.

     Source: the alloy forge recipe steel + RSW_Zersium -> durasteel (Patches/RSW_AlloyForge_Durasteel.xml,
     SHIP_ALLOY_FORGE_1). No mineable or deep-drill producer exists for it, by design.
     Donor durasteel conversion/redirects (OuterRim, LK, KOTOR recipes) are NOT in this def; they are separate work.

     PROVISIONAL: stackLimit 75 and the colour tint (steel's stack sprites tinted, material not paint, until our render
     lands through the art ledger). All other numbers are the donor's measured values, not invented. -->
